; Open enums named Core, Flow, Alloc and Std, beside an import from flow:
; their contract modules, core, flow, alloc and std, stand beside the paths
; the generated Rust writes, ::core::…, ::std::… and ::flow::Voice, and shadow
; none of them; no name is refused for the sake of Rust.
Signal
[ flow:[ Voice ] ]
[ Launch.Pair
  Stop.Mark ]
[ Launched
  Refused.String ]
[ Pair.{ Core Flow Alloc Std Voice }
  Mark.String ]
[ Core Flow Alloc Std ]
